  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biometric collection in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Organization for Migration (IOM) will support the Government of Canada with biometric collection and enrollment in Sudan for applicants currently residing in Sudan that are referred by the Immigration, Refugees, Citizenship of Canada (IRCC) for the Government of Canada. The project will ensure that the infrastructure and resources are planned and allocated in an adequate manner for IOM to assist beneficiaries and IRCC with biometric enrollment and further processing within Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
